{"id":"n16417-1-8","stage":3,"title":"간섭 · 干涉","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n16417-1-8-1","ko":"오빠가 내 일에 자꾸 이래라저래라 간섭을 해.","zh":"哥哥总是对我的事情指手画脚，爱干涉我。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오빠가","meaning":"哥哥，大哥","explanation":"오빠：哥哥，大哥；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"오빠","audio":"/audio/14e10e3b73bff8540288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68006","senseId":"2","lemma":"오빠","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"내","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일에","meaning":"事，工作","explanation":"일：事，工作；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"5","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"자꾸","meaning":"一直，总是","explanation":"자꾸：一直，总是","readings":[{"term":"자꾸","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70796","senseId":"1","lemma":"자꾸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이래라저래라","meaning":"“이리하여라 저리하여라(指手画脚)”的缩略语。","explanation":"이래라저래라：“이리하여라 저리하여라(指手画脚)”的缩略语。","readings":[{"term":"이래라저래라","audio":"/audio/b41b8f47c414b5f6817f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72096","senseId":"1","lemma":"이래라저래라","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"간섭을","meaning":"干涉","explanation":"간섭：干涉；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"간섭","audio":"/audio/204e72eb7c5d634dfac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16417","senseId":"1","lemma":"간섭","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"해.","meaning":"以某种方式构成行为。","explanation":"하다：以某种方式构成行为。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"25","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"14e10e3b73bff854","term":"오빠","zh":"哥哥，大哥","audio":"/audio/14e10e3b73bff8540288.mp3","entryId":"68006","definition":"女子用于亲切地指称或称呼比自己年长的男性。","pronunciation":["오빠"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事，工作","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"需要解决或处理的问题或事项。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"d28ff63a0382ce4f","term":"자꾸","zh":"一直，总是","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3","entryId":"70796","definition":"多次连续地。","pronunciation":["자꾸"]},{"id":"b41b8f47c414b5f6","term":"이래라저래라","zh":"“이리하여라 저리하여라(指手画脚)”的缩略语。","audio":"/audio/b41b8f47c414b5f6817f.mp3","entryId":"72096","definition":"“이리하여라 저리하여라(指手画脚)”的缩略语。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"204e72eb7c5d634d","term":"간섭","zh":"干涉","audio":"/audio/204e72eb7c5d634dfac0.mp3","entryId":"16417","definition":"干预跟自己没有直接关系的别人的事。","pronunciation":["간섭"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"以某种方式构成行为。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"以某种方式构成行为。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/2caf4140179dd0e4d2ae.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n16417-1-8-2","ko":"지나친 관심은 오히려 부담이 된다는 걸 모르나 봐.","zh":"他好像不明白，过度的关心反而会给人带来负担。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지나친","meaning":"过分，过度","explanation":"지나치다：过分，过度；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"지나치다","audio":"/audio/86b6476536bae9677938.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"90321","senseId":"1","lemma":"지나치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"관심은","meaning":"关注，关心，兴趣","explanation":"관심：关注，关心，兴趣；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"관심","audio":"/audio/07b3c15a29688a55c61b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60096","senseId":"1","lemma":"관심","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오히려","meaning":"却，反而","explanation":"오히려：却，反而","readings":[{"term":"오히려","audio":"/audio/b499084b40ea381f8c7f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"22037","senseId":"1","lemma":"오히려","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"부담이","meaning":"负担，压力，包袱","explanation":"부담：负担，压力，包袱；이：用在 아니다、되다 等前，标记否定或变化涉及的身份、状态。","readings":[{"term":"부담","audio":"/audio/4b06afc40b9b98abc40e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25696","senseId":"3","lemma":"부담","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"된다는","meaning":"变得，弄得","explanation":"되다：变得，弄得；ㄴ다는：引用陈述内容并修饰后面的名词。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"16","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"걸","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。；ㄹ：을/를 的缩略，标记宾语，如 뭘＝무엇을。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"모르나","meaning":"不知道，不认识，不懂","explanation":"모르다：不知道，不认识，不懂；나：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"모르다","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29712","senseId":"1","lemma":"모르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"봐.","meaning":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","explanation":"보다：看来、好像（根据情况推测）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"86b6476536bae967","term":"지나치다","zh":"过分，过度","audio":"/audio/86b6476536bae9677938.mp3","entryId":"90321","definition":"超出一定的标准，程度严重。","pronunciation":["지나치다"]},{"id":"07b3c15a29688a55","term":"관심","zh":"关注，关心，兴趣","audio":"/audio/07b3c15a29688a55c61b.mp3","entryId":"60096","definition":"被某种东西吸引的情感和想法。","pronunciation":["관심"]},{"id":"b499084b40ea381f","term":"오히려","zh":"却，反而","audio":"/audio/b499084b40ea381f8c7f.mp3","entryId":"22037","definition":"与通常预期或期待相反或不同地。","pronunciation":["오히려"]},{"id":"4b06afc40b9b98ab","term":"부담","zh":"负担，压力，包袱","audio":"/audio/4b06afc40b9b98abc40e.mp3","entryId":"25696","definition":"做某事时感觉到的为难的心情。","pronunciation":["부ː담"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"变得，弄得","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"达到某种情况或状态。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]},{"id":"20ef19694f337fd4","term":"모르다","zh":"不知道，不认识，不懂","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3","entryId":"29712","definition":"不清楚或不了解人或事物、事实等。","pronunciation":["모ː르다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/1887dd5a73e0391ddcae.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.174,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=16417","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":116,"sequenceScore":3.0007,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["哥哥总是对我的事情指手画脚，爱干涉我。","他好像不明白，过度的关心反而会给人带来负担。","如果宝宝一直哭怎么办？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["哥哥总是对我的事情指手画脚，爱干涉我。","他好像不明白，过度的关心反而会给人带来负担。","如果宝宝一直哭怎么办？"],"answer":1}]}
